>> title: Roasted Cauliflower
>> category: Vegetables & Sides
>> tags: cauliflower, roast, cumin, sheet pan, side
>> counters: The Bowl Shop
>> aka: roasted cauliflower, cauliflower steaks, roast cauliflower, cumin cauliflower, cauliflower slabs, oven cauliflower
>> pairs-with: tahini-sauce, zaatar
>> servings: 4
>> time: 45 min
>> step.1: cut the head into slabs through the core
>> step.2: toss with oil, cumin and coriander
>> step.3: roast 425°F (220°C) 25 min flat, then 8 min turned
>> step.4: finish with lemon and parsley

Halve @cauliflower{1%large head}(900 g; leaves on) top to bottom and cut each half into 1-in slabs **through the core**, so every piece hangs together on a stem and has two flat sides.

Toss @&(~1)cauliflower slabs{} with @olive oil{3%Tbs}(45 mL), @kosher salt{1 1/4%tsp}, @ground cumin{1%tsp} and @ground coriander{1/2%tsp}, pressing the spice onto the flat faces.

Roast @&(~1)spiced cauliflower{} flat side down on a #sheet pan{} at 425°F (220°C) ~roast{25%min} without touching it, then turn each slab and ~roast{8%min}.

Squeeze @lemon juice{1%Tbs}(15 mL) over @&(~1)roasted cauliflower{} while it is still on the hot pan and scatter @flat-leaf parsley{1/4%cup}(chopped) over it.
